Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.60,0:00:03.02,Alt,,0,0,0,,Rıza… bunun neresi şehir?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.27,0:00:07.92,Alt,,0,0,0,,Şehir merkezi burası aşkım!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.92,0:00:09.47,Alt,,0,0,0,,Bak, tabelası bile var.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.87,0:00:11.52,Alt,,0,0,0,,Tabelayı keçi yiyor, Rıza.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.69,0:00:18.19,Alt,,0,0,0,,On iki ev, bir depo, bir değirmen…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.49,0:00:19.24,Alt,,0,0,0,,Nüfus: üç.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.24,0:00:20.14,Alt,,0,0,0,,Üç bin mi?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.54,0:00:21.29,Alt,,0,0,0,,Üç.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.19,0:00:23.24,Alt,,0,0,0,,Kimin parasıyla?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.04,0:00:25.04,Alt,,0,0,0,,Dedemden kalan…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.74,0:00:26.69,Alt,,0,0,0,,biraz da birikim.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.57,0:00:28.47,Alt,,0,0,0,,Biraz dediğin?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.57,0:00:31.97,Alt,,0,0,0,,Ev için ayırdığımız kadar.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.52,0:00:36.82,Alt,,0,0,0,,Ama potansiyele bak!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.82,0:00:39.27,Alt,,0,0,0,,Şuraya kafe, şuraya ortak çalışma alanı—
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.89,0:00:45.59,Alt,,0,0,0,,Yeni sahipler siz misiniz?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.09,0:00:49.04,Alt,,0,0,0,,Öncekiler de böyle heyecanlıydı.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.86,0:00:50.86,Alt,,0,0,0,,Öncekiler mi?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.46,0:00:53.86,Alt,,0,0,0,,Üç gün dayandılar.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.91,0:00:55.66,Alt,,0,0,0,,Bu arada…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.06,0:00:57.51,Alt,,0,0,0,,köyün elektrik borcu.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.61,0:00:59.56,Alt,,0,0,0,,Artık sizin.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.93,0:01:02.53,Alt,,0,0,0,,Rıza.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.73,0:01:04.43,Alt,,0,0,0,,Kaç?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.40,0:01:07.85,KutuKoyu,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(540,270)\frz2\fad(0,250)\fscx70\fscy70\t(0,140,\fscx106\fscy106)\t(140,220,\fscx100\fscy100)}DEVAMI İÇİN
